findings.description:
Every item the plan assigns to 422 is present:
- discovery with no per-project configuration;
- frozen issue text;
- per-node hidden and superseded sets with added fixtures;
- the three fairness checks with real-commit examples;
- repeated qualification with exclusions in the case identity;
- environment-keyed records;
- the yield report on two projects.

Injection, the leak scan, replay and the paired bootstrap are correctly left to 424 and 425. Effort 4/5 matches the plan. The extra rejection reasons (`changes_lockfile`, `test_data_changed`, `modifies_test_support`) all exclude with a recorded reason, in line with the architecture.
